  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Accountant)\n\n### Capium 365: Setting up Templates\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 3 Jun, 2025 at  1:04 PM\n\n\t\tWelcome to our article on how to set up your templates in the Capium 365 module.\n\nNavigation: Capium 365 > Manage > Templates\n\nTo create a new template, press the purple ' + Create Template '\n\nYou will then be presented with a screen that you can populate.\n\nIf you would like to add reminder settings, ensure to press the 'Reminder Settings' button.\n\nOnce you have selected your due date when sending out your documents, you'll be able to set up a reminder based on frequency using the drop down.\n\nYou can also name the Document and what kind of a request you are making. The two Request Types are 'Regular' and 'ReadOnly'.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118596\">Capium 365</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000200518\">Capium 365 (Accountant)</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Capium 365: Setting up Templates\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 3 Jun, 2025 at  1:04 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">Welcome to our article on how to set up your templates in the Capium 365 module.</p><p><br></p><div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/66d4dc8aa1cd48a8b4aca6cab2caa794?sid=367419fa-907f-4eb3-b110-05283a6a4838\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation allow-popups\"></iframe></div><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: Capium 365 &gt; Manage &gt; Templates</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9231063367/original/ufOUPDBEcIg2Oy1gbJk9fulYzg9H88zTEA.png?1747060019\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9231063367\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">To create a new template, press the purple ' + Create Template '</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9231064912/original/EGbVeCaCIhfKasUo_u0A66gB8ERv7JQIYQ.png?1747061058\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9231064912\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You will then be presented with a screen that you can populate.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9231065033/original/qOmr_VOapPHPBsgLo1u-VsIbrDdaAj9lAw.png?1747061119\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9231065033\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">If you would like to add reminder settings, ensure to press the 'Reminder Settings' button.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9231068700/original/Pn6FNIWTdaxdxvN_o2QEzCsfQ61Oh56_oA.png?1747063688\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9231068700\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: top; max-width: 100%; position: relative; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin: 5px auto 5px 0px; display: block; float: none; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: auto;\">&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Once you have selected your due date when sending out your documents, you'll be able to set up a reminder based on frequency using the drop down.</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9231069348/original/aETQ_Wmo0nrzVzQX9mSVVHfpk37whd7Dzw.png?1747064131\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9231069348\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can also name the Document and what kind of a request you are making. The two Request Types are 'Regular' and 'ReadOnly'.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9231069676/original/mNzPdSwKVK9gp_WRPmG9h6Dw3Ts7b8JbJA.png?1747064369\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9231069676\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000268169\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000268169/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000268169\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000268169/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000268169\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=